EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

I am sorry to hear that you will not be joining us this upcoming semester. I wish you the best of luck in your future endeavors.

Please take a quick moment to officially cancel your admission at https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions. This will remove you from the system and from all call and email lists.

By submitting your request to cancel your admission, you are also cancelling any housing assignment and any financial awards (including scholarships). Be aware that you will still be responsible for any non-refundable housing charges or other university charges you may have incurred. You can view your account and pay any charges by signing in to My ASU at https://my.asu.edu.

Thank you for considering ASU during your college search.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
